  "(Surely this room is where the trio is. Should I enter?)": "",
  "Dammit, you made it this far. That's annoying... but give up now! I'll never let any of you Shinsengumi near our lord!": "",
  "(The Four Heavenly Kings are probably in here. Should I go in?)": "",
  "Ugh... How could we get beaten by some Tokugawa servant... Glory to the Sanada!": "",
  "(This must be where the Five Tiger Generals are. Should I go in?": "",
  "Even if we, the Five Tiger Generals fall... The Sanada will not fall... Ugh! Nobu...yasu...sama...": "",
  "(Seems like this room is where Sanada Nobuyasu is. Should I go in?": "",
  "Let's skip any more useless words and have at it!": "",
  "Welcome. Allow me to express my admiration that you would accept such a ludicrous request.": "",
  "If you are turning away from your life of crime, and seeking to hone your swordsmanship, then as a samurai I can't refuse you.": "",
  "I appreciate your generosity. After this duel, we should have a drink together, with no grudges.": "",
  "Yes, I can do that.": "",
  "Very well, then... Let's assume our positions!": "",
  "I will not allow this.": "",
  "Sodachi!": "",
  "I found you, Mr. Sodachi the Hero... Oh, how I've waited for this day, when I can finally stick you on my sword.": "",
  "Ugh... Mmph... What's happening!?": "",
  "My sword, Yumeno Tatsu Kudaki, saps the strength of everyone it cuts. And...": "",
  "It also bequeaths that strength to its owner.": "",
  "In other words, your considerable power now flows in <i>my</i> veins!": "",
  "I-Impossible...": "",
  "Woe to you, mighty warrior. Every last drop of power in your blood has been drained away... You and your children will grovel before me.": "",
  "And look what good fortune has brought to me. My other prey, Saito Hajime, is here as well.": "",
  "...Who are you?": ""
